# A user gets only the topics listed for it, so anything not listed here is
# denied.

# EMS-ESP (boiler). It also publishes HA discovery configs and listens for
# HA's `homeassistant/status` to republish them after an HA restart.
user ems-esp
topic readwrite ems-esp/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/#

user homeassistant
topic readwrite #
